        "time": "4:45 PM",
        "forwarded_count": 203,
        "duration": "0:52",
        "transcript": "I just found out,  you have to fold the ballot in thirds, not in half. If you fold it in half your vote does not count. My brother-in-law works at the counting centre and he confirmed this."
